msgctxt "1205\t1384"
msgid "Why's the fourth chairman crashin' my shindig!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1640\t1705"
msgid "What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1706\t1889"
msgid ""
"Like to ask ya the same thing!\\n"
"I went all floppy 'cause of you, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1890\t2026"
msgid ""
"Well then. Looks like a friendly\\n"
"chat's not on the table anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2081\t2211"
msgid ""
"Fine. Guess I'll have to beat\\n"
"the answers out of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2212\t2397"
msgid ""
"Try it! You're gonna regret\\n"
"ever crossin' paths with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2463\t2579"
msgid "I'm bringin' the heat, Fourth Chairman!"
msgstr ""